# Normalise to LF in the repository. Both maintainers are on Windows, where a
# checkout is CRLF, and a shell script committed with CRLF fails on the Ubuntu
# box with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M" - which reads as a missing
# bash rather than a line-ending problem and costs an hour.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
